In the meantime, there's something I need you to do for me....

&lt;Tony unhinges one of the weapons and peers down the barrel.&gt;

Oooh, very nice. Shiny. Loud. Now we're talkin'.

Not much left to do but close the deal...

&lt;Naralex slowly takes the squirming heart from you, visibly disturbed.&gt;

I've been a fool. The one truth I did not want to accept has been staring me in the face this entire time...this foul thing is proof of that.

You and I have much work to do.

Yay! Oh. Y-you saw someone? My papa?

&lt;Lynn hugs her toy and sniffs&gt;

I haven't seen my Mama in awhile. I hope she's okay.

&lt;You offer a short introduction, explaining you were sent by Sergeant Nazgrim.&gt;

Ah, so you're something in the way of reinforcements, then. Good.

Tormak and his men have need of your blade.

